                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='184' forceUpdate='true' h='6412' id='5' type-v2='text' w='81286' x='571' y='4412'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>In order to take out the unsyncronized inflation effect countries face, paramaterized %&apos;es can be used. Each country can put their threshold regarding to the situation. Also, to equalize different duration campaign markup %&apos;es; this dashboard uses </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Normalized markup %</run>
                    <run>, which is calculated by extrapolating daily markup % to 30 days. Entity level information can be seen with &apos;+&apos; sign on &quot;Region Segment&quot;.

It is suggested that last 12 Months avg Monthly inflation rate should be used for each country for [Min. Normalized Markup to flag a Campaign] parameter.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
